gocaca (github.com/unboxlumen/gocaca) is released under the WTFPL v2.

It is a Go port of the core of libcaca, the caca/ library sources at
https://github.com/cacalabs/libcaca. That core is distributed under the
WTFPL v2 as well; the GPL/LGPL files and the unlicensed font data in the
rest of the upstream tree are not used (see PROVENANCE.md).

